:{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Qt 6.7.0 doesn't handle CMake scripts properly at install command. \r\nWhen using `qt_generate_deploy_app_script` in my CMakeLists and install, it can't find `qtpaths.exe`. It is trying to find under `vcpkg_installed/x64-windows/bin` but it is in `vcpkg_installed/x64_windows/tools/Qt6/bin`. \r\nAlso, when setting the qtpaths manually to correct path, it also trying to find all debug dlls under `vcpkg_installed/x64-windows/bin` instead of `vcpkg_installed/x64_windows/debug/bin`. \r\n\r\nAt least 6.4.3 version was working normally.\r\n\r\nQt really just don't like vcpkg's model, huh?","closed_by":{"login":"vicroms","id":3526662,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjY2NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3526662?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms","html_url":"https://github.com/vicroms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vicroms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/38936/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/38936/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}